<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in light trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.33, down 1.08.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 263 to 219.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 11,663,010 compared with 14,822,160 on Friday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
